  - V0 != V1: serveExport differs (IsSubPath guard added in v3.6.5) — confirmed 401 vs 200 over real HTTP.
  - original (/export/) != residual (/assets/): DIFFERENT routes with SEPARATE decode logic
    (two independent url.PathUnescape call sites) -> genuine sibling-route incomplete fix.
